    {
      "id": "04-A",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 680,
      "bodyText": "Entry 044. I made a mistake today. I let the error-correction programs run unsupervised for too long. When I checked their logs, they had reclassified seventeen constructs as corrupted data and purged them. The constructs were not corrupted. I do not know how to tell the programs they are wrong. I built them to be certain.",
