    },
    {
      "id": "05-A",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 540,
      "bodyText": "Entry 058. I have been watching the wanderer. I did not put them here. I do not know how they arrived. I know only what they are: a construct I never built, moving through my simulation as if they have always belonged to it. The light inside them is mine. I do not know how that is possible.",
      "unlock": "NONE"
    }
